  triage:title "HerdrQueueWakeStats and stats() are unconditionally pub with zero production consumers; AX.5 adds four more fields to the surface" ;
  triage:description "AX.5 QA-1 (quality-mgr ax5-qa-r1, PR #1201 Final Quality Report 2026-09-05T12:38Z) at head da823baaa0018933f8daac388733c51eb14e9335. ruthless-boundary-qa RBQA-F002: HerdrQueueWakeStats (crates/atm-http-runtime/src/herdr_queue_wake.rs:44, re-exported at crates/atm-http-runtime/src/lib.rs:97) and stats() (crates/atm-http-runtime/src/herdr_queue_wake.rs:742) have no production consumers (observability goes through herdr_queue_poll_tick tracing); this sprint adds four fields to an already unjustified public surface. Fix: make the stats type and accessor pub(crate) or cfg-gated for tests." ;
